            "text": "<p>Given its many advantageous properties, Tyvek is used for countless parts and products for a wide range of industries and applications. Examples of typical use cases include:</p><ul><li>Building envelopes</li><li>Cargo covers</li><li>Controlled environment apparel</li><li>Envelopes</li><li>Graphics products</li><li>Industrial packaging</li><li>Protective apparel</li><li>Sterile packaging</li></ul>",
